{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JU7urGqfFsepzuUPKGNaaK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: GPQA 完整复现确认 phase-dependent compound severity 是跨三个推理 benchmark\n2\t  的稳健涌现属性。Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 ratio 5-12×，介于 MATH-500（15-17×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）之间，支持\n3\t  specificity 随 task difficulty 非单调变化的叙事（GPQA 最难但 ratio 不最高，暗示机制与 reasoning chain\n4\t  结构而非纯难度相关）。Three-way dissociation（importance gradient d_z≥0.8 / random NS或弱 / recency\n5\t  NS）在三个 benchmark 上成立，审稿人可将此视为方法论贡献。Claims 无需降级，empirical finding paper 定位完全成立。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n8\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n9\t  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.20\n10\t  expected_results:\n11\t    n_problems: 198\n12\t    high_median_ii: 0.042\n13\t    mid_median_ii: 0.38\n14\t    low_median_ii: 3.12\n15\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 3.08\n16\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n17\t    - 2.45\n18\t    - 3.82\n19\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-28\n20\t    cohens_dz: 0.88\n21\t    monotonic: true\n22\t    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n23\t    perplexity_high_both: 3.85\n24\t  result_rationale: GPQA s015 已显示 gradient=0.947，是 MATH-500 s015（0.39）的 2.4×。s020\n25\t    在 MATH-500 上 gradient=1.48，按 2.1× 缩放因子（考虑 sub-exponential growth 在更高 sparsity\n26\t    时比例略降）得 ~3.1。d_z 在 0.88 是因为 MATH-500 s020 d_z=0.73，GPQA 更长推理链使 per-problem 配对差异更一致（variance\n27\t    相对 mean 更小），n=198 的大样本进一步稳定估计。Growth factor s015→s020 约 3.25×，与 MATH-500 的 3.8×\n28\t    接近但略低——GPQA 问题异质性更大，部分短推理问题拉低增长。\n29\t  tables:\n30\t  - 'Table: GPQA Phase-Level II Statistics (s020)'\n31\t  - '| Phase | Median II | Mean II | 95% CI | n_segments |'\n32\t  - '| high  | 0.042     | 0.58    | [0.15, 1.32] | ~6200 |'\n33\t  - '| mid   | 0.38      | 2.85    | [2.12, 3.64] | ~2100 |'\n34\t  - '| low   | 3.12      | 12.4    | [10.1, 15.2] | ~5100 |'\n35\t  figures_description:\n36\t  - 'Fig: GPQA dose-response curve adding s020 data point, showing monotonic increase\n37\t    from s015 gradient=0.95 to s020 gradient=3.08'\n38\t  analysis: s020 确认 GPQA 上 dose-response 单调性。d_z=0.88 首次跨越 0.8 阈值（s015 预计约 0.72，略低于\n39\t    0.8），支撑 best tier 的核心假设。GPQA 与 MATH-500 在 s020 的 gradient 比例（3.08/1.48=2.08×）较\n40\t    s015 比例（0.95/0.39=2.4×）有所收敛，暗示极端 sparsity 下 benchmark 差异减小。\n41\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n42\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n43\t  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.25\n44\t  expected_results:\n45\t    n_problems: 198\n46\t    high_median_ii: 0.098\n47\t    mid_median_ii: 1.85\n48\t    low_median_ii: 8.72\n49\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 8.62\n50\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n51\t    - 6.93\n52\t    - 10.85\n53\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.5e-34\n54\t    cohens_dz: 1.12\n55\t    monotonic: true\n56\t    perplexity_low_both: 85.2\n57\t    perplexity_high_both: 5.42\n58\t    median_ratio_low_high: 89.0\n59\t  result_rationale: MATH-500 s025 gradient=3.99（n=500），GPQA 按 2.16× 缩放因子（从 s020 的\n60\t    2.08× 进一步微降）得 ~8.6。d_z=1.12 对应 MATH-500 的 0.95 + GPQA 的更高信噪比（n=198 长序列 per-problem\n61\t    variance 在高 sparsity 趋于收敛，因所有问题的 low-phase 都受严重损伤）。Growth factor s020→s025 约 2.8×，低于\n62\t    MATH-500 的 3.3×，符合 sub-exponential 预期——GPQA 在 s025 已进入 severe degradation 区域，部分问题\n63\t    II 值 saturate。\n64\t  tables:\n65\t  - 'Table: GPQA Phase-Level II Statistics (s025)'\n66\t  - '| Phase | Median II | Mean II | 95% CI | Skewness |'\n67\t  - '| high  | 0.098     | 0.92    | [0.41, 1.68] | ~8.5 |'\n68\t  - '| mid   | 1.85      | 9.8     | [7.2, 13.1]  | ~7.2 |'\n69\t  - '| low   | 8.72      | 42.6    | [33.5, 53.8] | ~6.8 |'\n70\t  figures_description:\n71\t  - 'Fig: GPQA s025 per-problem paired difference distribution (histogram) showing\n72\t    strong rightward shift with heavy tail'\n73\t  analysis: s025 是论文的 'sweet spot' sparsity —— gradient 足够大以产生 visually compelling\n74\t    结果，但不至于 numerical instability。d_z=1.12 远超 0.8 阈值。与 MATH-500 crossover 现象（importance\n75\t    high<random, importance low>random）的 GPQA 版本预计在此 sparsity 出现：random high_median\n76\t    应在 1.5-3.0 范围而 importance high 仅 0.098，crossover 确认。\n77\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n78\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n79\t  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\n80\t  expected_results:\n81\t    n_problems: 198\n82\t    high_median_ii: 0.175\n83\t    mid_median_ii: 3.62\n84\t    low_median_ii: 10.85\n85\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 10.68\n86\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n87\t    - 8.42\n88\t    - 13.95\n89\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-36\n90\t    cohens_dz: 1.22\n91\t    monotonic: true\n92\t    perplexity_low_both: 152.8\n93\t    perplexity_high_both: 7.93\n94\t    median_ratio_low_high: 62.0\n95\t    growth_factor_s025_to_s030: 1.24\n96\t  result_rationale: Best tier 指标要求 gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030 ∈ [4.0, 12.0]。预测\n97\t    10.68 落在此范围上部。MATH-500 s030 gradient=8.48（n=500），GPQA 按 1.26× 缩放（缩放因子在高 sparsity\n98\t    收敛至接近 1，因为极端 sparsity 下所有 benchmark 的 compound interaction 都趋于饱和——KV cache 被严重截断时\n99\t    perplexity 已接近随机，进一步截断的 marginal effect 减小）。Growth factor s025→s030 仅 1.24×，远低于\n100\t    s020→s025 的 2.8×，与 MATH-500 的 2.0× 模式一致——sub-exponential growth 在最高 sparsity 明显减速。d_z=1.22\n101\t    为 GPQA 最高，因 paired difference 分布在高 sparsity 下更集中（几乎所有问题都显示强 gradient）。\n102\t  tables:\n103\t  - 'Table: GPQA Dose-Response Summary (Importance, DeepSeek)'\n104\t  - '| Sparsity | Median Gradient | d_z  | p-value   | Monotonic |'\n105\t  - '| 0.15     | 0.947 (actual)  | 0.72 | <1e-20    | ✓         |'\n106\t  - '| 0.20     | 3.08            | 0.88 | ~1e-28    | ✓         |'\n107\t  - '| 0.25     | 8.62            | 1.12 | ~3e-34    | ✓         |'\n108\t  - '| 0.30     | 10.68           | 1.22 | ~8e-36    | ✓         |'\n109\t  figures_description:\n110\t  - 'Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K) showing\n111\t    GPQA gradient consistently highest, all monotonic'\n112\t  - 'Fig: GPQA per-phase perplexity heatmap at s030 showing extreme low-phase degradation'\n113\t  analysis: s030 gradient=10.68 在 best tier 范围 [4.0, 12.0] 内。值得注意的是 GPQA/MATH-500\n114\t    gradient ratio 从 s015 的 2.4× 收敛至 s030 的 1.26×——这不是 GPQA 效应弱，而是 compound degradation\n115\t    在极端 sparsity 下有 ceiling effect。这一收敛本身是有趣的 finding：harder benchmark 在低 sparsity\n116\t    时 amplification 更大（longer reasoning chain → more tokens in vulnerable low phase），但在极端\n117\t    sparsity 时所有 benchmark converge（因 perplexity 已接近随机 token prediction）。\n118\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n119\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n120\t  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.15 — baseline\n121\t    for ratio calculation\n122\t  expected_results:\n123\t    n_problems: 198\n124\t    high_median_ii: 0.11\n125\t    mid_median_ii: 0.14\n126\t    low_median_ii: 0.13\n127\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.02\n128\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n129\t    - -0.08\n130\t    - 0.12\n131\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.62\n132\t    cohens_dz: 0.04\n133\t    significant: false\n134\t    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 47.4\n135\t  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s015 在 DS 上完全 NS（median_diff=0.0095, p=NS），gradient\n136\t    本质为零。GPQA 的 random masking 在 s015 同样预期 NS——随机删除 15% KV entries 产生的 compound effect\n137\t    不足以形成 phase-specific 差异。Random masking 的 compound interaction 绝对值不为零（II 本身 positive），但\n138\t    phase gradient 为零——这正是 'strategy specificity' 的核心证据。ratio=0.95/0.02≈47× 但因 random\n139\t    分母接近零，实际报告为 'importance significant, random NS'。\n140\t  tables: []\n141\t  figures_description: []\n142\t  analysis: Random s015 NS 确认 GPQA 上低 sparsity 的 strategy specificity 与 MATH-500 一致。\n143\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n144\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n145\t  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.20\n146\t  expected_results:\n147\t    n_problems: 198\n148\t    high_median_ii: 0.28\n149\t    mid_median_ii: 0.35\n150\t    low_median_ii: 0.42\n151\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.14\n152\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n153\t    - -0.05\n154\t    - 0.35\n155\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.18\n156\t    cohens_dz: 0.1\n157\t    significant: false\n158\t    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 22.0\n159\t  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s020 在 DS 上 NS（median_diff=-0.016）。GPQA 的 random\n160\t    s020 也预期 NS，但 median 绝对值略高于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 问题更长，random 删除的 total token 量更大，产生更大的\n161\t    baseline II）。Phase gradient 仍为零或可忽略——ratio 3.08/0.14≈22× 使 strategy specificity\n162\t    在 s020 极为显著。s020 位于 MATH-500 观察到的 onset threshold (~s020-s025) 之下，GPQA 上也预计 random\n163\t    尚未 'turn on'。\n164\t  tables: []\n165\t  figures_description: []\n166\t  analysis: Random s020 NS 支持 onset threshold 约为 s020-s025 的跨 benchmark 一致性。\n167\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n168\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n169\t  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.25\n170\t  expected_results:\n171\t    n_problems: 198\n172\t    high_median_ii: 0.82\n173\t    mid_median_ii: 1.05\n174\t    low_median_ii: 1.58\n175\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.76\n176\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n177\t    - 0.28\n178\t    - 1.35\n179\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.0034\n180\t    cohens_dz: 0.22\n181\t    significant: true\n182\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 11.3\n183\t  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s025 在 DS n=500 上刚达显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.257）。GPQA\n184\t    有 n=198 且更长序列，预计 random 在 s025 跨越 onset threshold 但效应量远小于 importance。Gradient\n185\t    0.76 vs importance 8.62 → ratio≈11.3×，在 best tier 范围 [5, 15] 内。Random 的 phase\n186\t    gradient 出现是因为 25% 随机删除在 low-sparsity phase（token 更密集、attention 分布更集中）造成更大绝对损伤——但这是\n187\t    trivial 的 token-count 效应而非 attention-score-based 的放大，magnitude 远小于 importance。\n188\t  tables:\n189\t  - 'Table: GPQA Strategy Comparison at s025'\n190\t  - '| Strategy   | Gradient | d_z  | p-value | Ratio |'\n191\t  - '| Importance | 8.62     | 1.12 | 3e-34   | ref   |'\n192\t  - '| Random     | 0.76     | 0.22 | 0.003   | 11.3× |'\n193\t  - '| Recency    | ~0 (NS)  | <0.1 | >0.5    | >100× |'\n194\t  figures_description:\n195\t  - 'Fig: Three-strategy comparison bar plot at s025 showing importance >> random\n196\t    >> recency gradient'\n197\t  analysis: s025 是 three-way dissociation 最清晰的 sparsity level：importance 有强 gradient，random\n198\t    有弱但显著 gradient，recency 无 gradient。这正是 best tier 要求的 'three-way dissociation 被审稿人认可为方法论贡献'\n199\t    的核心证据。\n200\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n201\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n202\t  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\n203\t  expected_results:\n204\t    n_problems: 198\n205\t    high_median_ii: 2.15\n206\t    mid_median_ii: 2.68\n207\t    low_median_ii: 3.52\n208\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.37\n209\t    bootstrap_ci_95:\n210\t    - 0.55\n211\t    - 2.42\n212\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n213\t    cohens_dz: 0.28\n214\t    significant: true\n215\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 7.8\n216\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 random s030 在 DS n=500 上显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.510）。GPQA\n217\t    预计 random s030 gradient ~1.37——高于 MATH-500 的 0.51（2.7× 缩放，与 importance 在低 sparsity\n218\t    时的缩放比例接近）。Ratio 10.68/1.37≈7.8×，仍在 [5, 15] 范围内。Random gradient 在 s030 增长但仍远小于\n219\t    importance——这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS: importance 8.48 vs random 0.51 = 16.6×; GPQA\n220\t    预测 7.8× 较低是因为 random 在 GPQA 上 scales slightly more due to longer sequences）。'\n221\t  tables:\n222\t  - 'Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (Both Strategies)'\n223\t  - '| Sparsity | Imp Gradient | Rand Gradient | Ratio  |'\n224\t  - '| 0.15     | 0.947        | 0.02 (NS)     | >40×   |'\n225\t  - '| 0.20     | 3.08         | 0.14 (NS)     | ~22×   |'\n226\t  - '| 0.25     | 8.62         | 0.76          | 11.3×  |'\n227\t  - '| 0.30     | 10.68        | 1.37          | 7.8×   |'\n228\t  figures_description:\n229\t  - 'Fig: GPQA imp/rand ratio vs sparsity curve, overlaid with MATH-500 and GSM8K\n230\t    ratios — showing GPQA between MATH-500 and GSM8K'\n231\t  analysis: Ratio 从 >40× (s015) 递减至 7.8× (s030) 是预期行为：随 sparsity 增加，random masking\n232\t    也开始 'feel' compound interaction（simply because 30% deletion is aggressive enough\n233\t    to disrupt even without attention-score bias），但 importance masking 的 amplification\n234\t    始终主导。GPQA 的 average ratio ≈12×，介于 MATH-500（15-17×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）之间，满足 best\n235\t    tier 对 cross_benchmark_specificity_range 的要求（3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio > 5×）。\n236\t- name: gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\n237\t  plan_id: cross_benchmark_synthesis\n238\t  description: 综合分析：GPQA + MATH-500 + GSM8K 三 benchmark strategy specificity 对比\n239\t  expected_results:\n240\t    gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030: 10.68\n241\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_average: 10.3\n242\t    cross_benchmark_specificity:\n243\t      math500_ratio_s025: 15.5\n244\t      math500_ratio_s030: 16.6\n245\t      gpqa_ratio_s025: 11.3\n246\t      gpqa_ratio_s030: 7.8\n247\t      gsm8k_ratio_s025: 3.8\n248\t      gsm8k_ratio_s030: 2.8\n249\t    benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x: 2\n250\t    benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x_names:\n251\t    - MATH-500\n252\t    - GPQA\n253\t    recency_max_dz_across_sparsities: 0.096\n254\t    reviewer_novelty_score: 4.0\n255\t    reviewer_overall_score: 3.75\n256\t    acceptance_probability: 0.65\n257\t  result_rationale: Strategy specificity 排序为 MATH-500 > GPQA > GSM8K。这不是简单的 'harder\n258\t    benchmark = higher ratio'（GPQA 比 MATH-500 难但 ratio 更低），而是与 reasoning chain 结构有关：MATH-500\n259\t    的推理过程高度结构化（步骤清晰、phase transition 锐利），GPQA 的推理更 exploratory（多次 backtracking、longer\n260\t    uncertain phases），GSM8K 推理最短最简单。Ratio 与推理链的 'phase sharpness' 相关而非纯难度——这解释了为何\n261\t    GPQA ratio（7-11×）介于两者之间。审稿人 novelty=4.0 因为 three-way dissociation 是全新实验设计贡献；overall=3.75\n262\t    因为缺乏 practical method 限制了影响力评分但 empirical contribution 被认可。\n263\t  tables:\n264\t  - 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Summary'\n265\t  - '| Benchmark | Difficulty | Avg Chain Len | Ratio (s025) | Ratio (s030) |'\n266\t  - '| MATH-500  | Medium     | ~2.5k tokens  | 15.5×        | 16.6×        |'\n267\t  - '| GPQA      | Hard       | ~6.2k tokens  | 11.3×        | 7.8×         |'\n268\t  - '| GSM8K     | Easy       | ~0.9k tokens  | 3.8×         | 2.8×         |'\n269\t  figures_description:\n270\t  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (3 benchmarks × 4 sparsities) — visual demonstration\n271\t    that MATH-500 and GPQA consistently show ratio>5× while GSM8K does not'\n272\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of average reasoning chain length vs imp/rand ratio, suggesting\n273\t    ratio correlates with phase structure complexity'\n274\t  analysis: 'Best tier 核心判定：(1) GPQA gradient 单调且 d_z≥0.8 at s020+ ✓ (2) imp/rand\n275\t    ratio 在 GPQA 上 5-11× > GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× ✓ (3) recency max d_z=0.096 < 0.15 ✓ (4)\n276\t    3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio>5× ✓。审稿人认可 five contributions: (a) phase-dependent severity\n277\t    discovery, (b) quantified dose-response with sub-exponential growth, (c) discrimination\n278\t    collapse mechanism, (d) cross-architecture replication with architecture-dependent\n279\t    specificity, (e) scoring-independent control as novel experimental design。Claims\n280\t    无需降级，acceptance probability 0.65 在 best tier 范围 [0.55, 0.75] 中部。'\n281\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7283b627-1227-4165-befd-d2d2cc7a2bc4","uuid":"cb438bdc-b882-446a-b86b-c6869be4d376","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:57:43.688Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T013445/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: GPQA 完整复现确认 phase-dependent compound severity 是跨三个推理 benchmark\n  的稳健涌现属性。Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 ratio 5-12×，介于 MATH-500（15-17×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）之间，支持\n  specificity 随 task difficulty 非单调变化的叙事（GPQA 最难但 ratio 不最高，暗示机制与 reasoning chain\n  结构而非纯难度相关）。Three-way dissociation（importance gradient d_z≥0.8 / random NS或弱 / recency\n  NS）在三个 benchmark 上成立，审稿人可将此视为方法论贡献。Claims 无需降级，empirical finding paper 定位完全成立。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.20\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.042\n    mid_median_ii: 0.38\n    low_median_ii: 3.12\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 3.08\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 2.45\n    - 3.82\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-28\n    cohens_dz: 0.88\n    monotonic: true\n    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n    perplexity_high_both: 3.85\n  result_rationale: GPQA s015 已显示 gradient=0.947，是 MATH-500 s015（0.39）的 2.4×。s020\n    在 MATH-500 上 gradient=1.48，按 2.1× 缩放因子（考虑 sub-exponential growth 在更高 sparsity\n    时比例略降）得 ~3.1。d_z 在 0.88 是因为 MATH-500 s020 d_z=0.73，GPQA 更长推理链使 per-problem 配对差异更一致（variance\n    相对 mean 更小），n=198 的大样本进一步稳定估计。Growth factor s015→s020 约 3.25×，与 MATH-500 的 3.8×\n    接近但略低——GPQA 问题异质性更大，部分短推理问题拉低增长。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA Phase-Level II Statistics (s020)'\n  - '| Phase | Median II | Mean II | 95% CI | n_segments |'\n  - '| high  | 0.042     | 0.58    | [0.15, 1.32] | ~6200 |'\n  - '| mid   | 0.38      | 2.85    | [2.12, 3.64] | ~2100 |'\n  - '| low   | 3.12      | 12.4    | [10.1, 15.2] | ~5100 |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GPQA dose-response curve adding s020 data point, showing monotonic increase\n    from s015 gradient=0.95 to s020 gradient=3.08'\n  analysis: s020 确认 GPQA 上 dose-response 单调性。d_z=0.88 首次跨越 0.8 阈值（s015 预计约 0.72，略低于\n    0.8），支撑 best tier 的核心假设。GPQA 与 MATH-500 在 s020 的 gradient 比例（3.08/1.48=2.08×）较\n    s015 比例（0.95/0.39=2.4×）有所收敛，暗示极端 sparsity 下 benchmark 差异减小。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.25\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.098\n    mid_median_ii: 1.85\n    low_median_ii: 8.72\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 8.62\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 6.93\n    - 10.85\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.5e-34\n    cohens_dz: 1.12\n    monotonic: true\n    perplexity_low_both: 85.2\n    perplexity_high_both: 5.42\n    median_ratio_low_high: 89.0\n  result_rationale: MATH-500 s025 gradient=3.99（n=500），GPQA 按 2.16× 缩放因子（从 s020 的\n    2.08× 进一步微降）得 ~8.6。d_z=1.12 对应 MATH-500 的 0.95 + GPQA 的更高信噪比（n=198 长序列 per-problem\n    variance 在高 sparsity 趋于收敛，因所有问题的 low-phase 都受严重损伤）。Growth factor s020→s025 约 2.8×，低于\n    MATH-500 的 3.3×，符合 sub-exponential 预期——GPQA 在 s025 已进入 severe degradation 区域，部分问题\n    II 值 saturate。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA Phase-Level II Statistics (s025)'\n  - '| Phase | Median II | Mean II | 95% CI | Skewness |'\n  - '| high  | 0.098     | 0.92    | [0.41, 1.68] | ~8.5 |'\n  - '| mid   | 1.85      | 9.8     | [7.2, 13.1]  | ~7.2 |'\n  - '| low   | 8.72      | 42.6    | [33.5, 53.8] | ~6.8 |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GPQA s025 per-problem paired difference distribution (histogram) showing\n    strong rightward shift with heavy tail'\n  analysis: s025 是论文的 'sweet spot' sparsity —— gradient 足够大以产生 visually compelling\n    结果，但不至于 numerical instability。d_z=1.12 远超 0.8 阈值。与 MATH-500 crossover 现象（importance\n    high<random, importance low>random）的 GPQA 版本预计在此 sparsity 出现：random high_median\n    应在 1.5-3.0 范围而 importance high 仅 0.098，crossover 确认。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  description: DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.175\n    mid_median_ii: 3.62\n    low_median_ii: 10.85\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 10.68\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 8.42\n    - 13.95\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-36\n    cohens_dz: 1.22\n    monotonic: true\n    perplexity_low_both: 152.8\n    perplexity_high_both: 7.93\n    median_ratio_low_high: 62.0\n    growth_factor_s025_to_s030: 1.24\n  result_rationale: Best tier 指标要求 gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030 ∈ [4.0, 12.0]。预测\n    10.68 落在此范围上部。MATH-500 s030 gradient=8.48（n=500），GPQA 按 1.26× 缩放（缩放因子在高 sparsity\n    收敛至接近 1，因为极端 sparsity 下所有 benchmark 的 compound interaction 都趋于饱和——KV cache 被严重截断时\n    perplexity 已接近随机，进一步截断的 marginal effect 减小）。Growth factor s025→s030 仅 1.24×，远低于\n    s020→s025 的 2.8×，与 MATH-500 的 2.0× 模式一致——sub-exponential growth 在最高 sparsity 明显减速。d_z=1.22\n    为 GPQA 最高，因 paired difference 分布在高 sparsity 下更集中（几乎所有问题都显示强 gradient）。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA Dose-Response Summary (Importance, DeepSeek)'\n  - '| Sparsity | Median Gradient | d_z  | p-value   | Monotonic |'\n  - '| 0.15     | 0.947 (actual)  | 0.72 | <1e-20    | ✓         |'\n  - '| 0.20     | 3.08            | 0.88 | ~1e-28    | ✓         |'\n  - '| 0.25     | 8.62            | 1.12 | ~3e-34    | ✓         |'\n  - '| 0.30     | 10.68           | 1.22 | ~8e-36    | ✓         |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K) showing\n    GPQA gradient consistently highest, all monotonic'\n  - 'Fig: GPQA per-phase perplexity heatmap at s030 showing extreme low-phase degradation'\n  analysis: s030 gradient=10.68 在 best tier 范围 [4.0, 12.0] 内。值得注意的是 GPQA/MATH-500\n    gradient ratio 从 s015 的 2.4× 收敛至 s030 的 1.26×——这不是 GPQA 效应弱，而是 compound degradation\n    在极端 sparsity 下有 ceiling effect。这一收敛本身是有趣的 finding：harder benchmark 在低 sparsity\n    时 amplification 更大（longer reasoning chain → more tokens in vulnerable low phase），但在极端\n    sparsity 时所有 benchmark converge（因 perplexity 已接近随机 token prediction）。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.15 — baseline\n    for ratio calculation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.11\n    mid_median_ii: 0.14\n    low_median_ii: 0.13\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.02\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - -0.08\n    - 0.12\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.62\n    cohens_dz: 0.04\n    significant: false\n    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 47.4\n  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s015 在 DS 上完全 NS（median_diff=0.0095, p=NS），gradient\n    本质为零。GPQA 的 random masking 在 s015 同样预期 NS——随机删除 15% KV entries 产生的 compound effect\n    不足以形成 phase-specific 差异。Random masking 的 compound interaction 绝对值不为零（II 本身 positive），但\n    phase gradient 为零——这正是 'strategy specificity' 的核心证据。ratio=0.95/0.02≈47× 但因 random\n    分母接近零，实际报告为 'importance significant, random NS'。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Random s015 NS 确认 GPQA 上低 sparsity 的 strategy specificity 与 MATH-500 一致。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.20\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.28\n    mid_median_ii: 0.35\n    low_median_ii: 0.42\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.14\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - -0.05\n    - 0.35\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.18\n    cohens_dz: 0.1\n    significant: false\n    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 22.0\n  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s020 在 DS 上 NS（median_diff=-0.016）。GPQA 的 random\n    s020 也预期 NS，但 median 绝对值略高于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 问题更长，random 删除的 total token 量更大，产生更大的\n    baseline II）。Phase gradient 仍为零或可忽略——ratio 3.08/0.14≈22× 使 strategy specificity\n    在 s020 极为显著。s020 位于 MATH-500 观察到的 onset threshold (~s020-s025) 之下，GPQA 上也预计 random\n    尚未 'turn on'。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Random s020 NS 支持 onset threshold 约为 s020-s025 的跨 benchmark 一致性。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.25\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.82\n    mid_median_ii: 1.05\n    low_median_ii: 1.58\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.76\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.28\n    - 1.35\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.0034\n    cohens_dz: 0.22\n    significant: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 11.3\n  result_rationale: MATH-500 random s025 在 DS n=500 上刚达显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.257）。GPQA\n    有 n=198 且更长序列，预计 random 在 s025 跨越 onset threshold 但效应量远小于 importance。Gradient\n    0.76 vs importance 8.62 → ratio≈11.3×，在 best tier 范围 [5, 15] 内。Random 的 phase\n    gradient 出现是因为 25% 随机删除在 low-sparsity phase（token 更密集、attention 分布更集中）造成更大绝对损伤——但这是\n    trivial 的 token-count 效应而非 attention-score-based 的放大，magnitude 远小于 importance。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA Strategy Comparison at s025'\n  - '| Strategy   | Gradient | d_z  | p-value | Ratio |'\n  - '| Importance | 8.62     | 1.12 | 3e-34   | ref   |'\n  - '| Random     | 0.76     | 0.22 | 0.003   | 11.3× |'\n  - '| Recency    | ~0 (NS)  | <0.1 | >0.5    | >100× |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-strategy comparison bar plot at s025 showing importance >> random\n    >> recency gradient'\n  analysis: s025 是 three-way dissociation 最清晰的 sparsity level：importance 有强 gradient，random\n    有弱但显著 gradient，recency 无 gradient。这正是 best tier 要求的 'three-way dissociation 被审稿人认可为方法论贡献'\n    的核心证据。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  description: DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 2.15\n    mid_median_ii: 2.68\n    low_median_ii: 3.52\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.37\n    bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.55\n    - 2.42\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n    cohens_dz: 0.28\n    significant: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 7.8\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 random s030 在 DS n=500 上显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.510）。GPQA\n    预计 random s030 gradient ~1.37——高于 MATH-500 的 0.51（2.7× 缩放，与 importance 在低 sparsity\n    时的缩放比例接近）。Ratio 10.68/1.37≈7.8×，仍在 [5, 15] 范围内。Random gradient 在 s030 增长但仍远小于\n    importance——这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS: importance 8.48 vs random 0.51 = 16.6×; GPQA\n    预测 7.8× 较低是因为 random 在 GPQA 上 scales slightly more due to longer sequences）。'\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (Both Strategies)'\n  - '| Sparsity | Imp Gradient | Rand Gradient | Ratio  |'\n  - '| 0.15     | 0.947        | 0.02 (NS)     | >40×   |'\n  - '| 0.20     | 3.08         | 0.14 (NS)     | ~22×   |'\n  - '| 0.25     | 8.62         | 0.76          | 11.3×  |'\n  - '| 0.30     | 10.68        | 1.37          | 7.8×   |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GPQA imp/rand ratio vs sparsity curve, overlaid with MATH-500 and GSM8K\n    ratios — showing GPQA between MATH-500 and GSM8K'\n  analysis: Ratio 从 >40× (s015) 递减至 7.8× (s030) 是预期行为：随 sparsity 增加，random masking\n    也开始 'feel' compound interaction（simply because 30% deletion is aggressive enough\n    to disrupt even without attention-score bias），但 importance masking 的 amplification\n    始终主导。GPQA 的 average ratio ≈12×，介于 MATH-500（15-17×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）之间，满足 best\n    tier 对 cross_benchmark_specificity_range 的要求（3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio > 5×）。\n- name: gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\n  plan_id: cross_benchmark_synthesis\n  description: 综合分析：GPQA + MATH-500 + GSM8K 三 benchmark strategy specificity 对比\n  expected_results:\n    gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030: 10.68\n    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_average: 10.3\n    cross_benchmark_specificity:\n      math500_ratio_s025: 15.5\n      math500_ratio_s030: 16.6\n      gpqa_ratio_s025: 11.3\n      gpqa_ratio_s030: 7.8\n      gsm8k_ratio_s025: 3.8\n      gsm8k_ratio_s030: 2.8\n    benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x: 2\n    benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x_names:\n    - MATH-500\n    - GPQA\n    recency_max_dz_across_sparsities: 0.096\n    reviewer_novelty_score: 4.0\n    reviewer_overall_score: 3.75\n    acceptance_probability: 0.65\n  result_rationale: Strategy specificity 排序为 MATH-500 > GPQA > GSM8K。这不是简单的 'harder\n    benchmark = higher ratio'（GPQA 比 MATH-500 难但 ratio 更低），而是与 reasoning chain 结构有关：MATH-500\n    的推理过程高度结构化（步骤清晰、phase transition 锐利），GPQA 的推理更 exploratory（多次 backtracking、longer\n    uncertain phases），GSM8K 推理最短最简单。Ratio 与推理链的 'phase sharpness' 相关而非纯难度——这解释了为何\n    GPQA ratio（7-11×）介于两者之间。审稿人 novelty=4.0 因为 three-way dissociation 是全新实验设计贡献；overall=3.75\n    因为缺乏 practical method 限制了影响力评分但 empirical contribution 被认可。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Summary'\n  - '| Benchmark | Difficulty | Avg Chain Len | Ratio (s025) | Ratio (s030) |'\n  - '| MATH-500  | Medium     | ~2.5k tokens  | 15.5×        | 16.6×        |'\n  - '| GPQA      | Hard       | ~6.2k tokens  | 11.3×        | 7.8×         |'\n  - '| GSM8K     | Easy       | ~0.9k tokens  | 3.8×         | 2.8×         |'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (3 benchmarks × 4 sparsities) — visual demonstration\n    that MATH-500 and GPQA consistently show ratio>5× while GSM8K does not'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of average reasoning chain length vs imp/rand ratio, suggesting\n    ratio correlates with phase structure complexity'\n  analysis: 'Best tier 核心判定：(1) GPQA gradient 单调且 d_z≥0.8 at s020+ ✓ (2) imp/rand\n    ratio 在 GPQA 上 5-11× > GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× ✓ (3) recency max d_z=0.096 < 0.15 ✓ (4)\n    3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio>5× ✓。审稿人认可 five contributions: (a) phase-dependent severity\n    discovery, (b) quantified dose-response with sub-exponential growth, (c) discrimination\n    collapse mechanism, (d) cross-architecture replication with architecture-dependent\n    specificity, (e) scoring-independent control as novel experimental design。Claims\n    无需降级，acceptance probability 0.65 在 best tier 范围 [0.55, 0.75] 中部。'\n","numLines":281,"startLine":1,"totalLines":281}}}
