-16 | 撤回 D091 Findings track framing 决策，按 EMNLP main con | — |\\\\n| D096 | 2026-05-16 | Session 15 决策：c10 等 c5 释放 GPU、Paper Agent 启动 Findi | c5_per_phase_gini, c8_llama_n250_fixed, c10_lang_switching |\\\\n| D095 | 2026-05-16 | c8_llama_n250 数据丢失，GPU 2/3 立即重跑；c10 排队等 c5 释放 GPU | c8_llama_n250, c10_lang_switching, c5_per_phase_gini |\\\\n| D094 | 2026-05-16 | c8_llama_n250 数据全丢事故——c10 越权 GPU 使用导致级联失败，c8 需从头重跑 | c8_llama_n250, c10_lang_switching |\\\\n| D093 | 2026-05-16 | <think> phase validation 达标：adaptive κ=0.8804, AUC | c4_think_validation_math500 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3896, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UnNfNKkkjeQrNwTuPxrUhk","session_id":"7283b627-1227-4165-befd-d2d2cc7a2bc4","uuid":"501405bb-b756-4aee-b6e7-cc1179445b8b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:59:00.073Z"}
